
This directory is intended for project header files.

A header file is a file containing C declarations and macro definitions
to be shared between several project source files. Request for including
a header file in a program source file is done by the C preprocessing
directive "#include".

For more information on PlatformIO project structure, see:
https://docs.platformio.org/page/projectconf/sections/platformio/options/directory/include_dir.html
